{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00287","headline":"游长宁公主流杯池二十五首 十三 · 上官昭容","name":"游长宁公主流杯池二十五首 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"策杖临霞岫，危步下霜蹊。\n志逐深山静，途随曲涧迷。\n渐觉心神逸，俄看云雾低。\n莫怪人题树，祗爲赏幽栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官昭容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}